1.HALF DIAMOND STAR PATTERN 
Given an integer n, print the Half Diamond Star Pattern using * characters as shown in the examples.
SOURCE CODE : 
        import java.util.Scanner;
        class GFG {
            public static void main(String[] args) {
                Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
                int n = sc.nextInt();
                // code here
                for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){
                    for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){
                        System.out.print("* ");
                    }
                    System.out.println();
                }
                for(int i=n-1;i>=1;i--){
                    for(int j=1;j<=i;j++){
                        System.out.print("* ");
                    }
                    System.out.println();
                }
            }
        }
PROBLEM LINK : https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/triangle-pattern-1661718013/1


