3.PRINT HOLLOW RECTANGLE 
Given two integers n and m, print a hollow rectangle pattern consisting of n rows and m columns.
SOURCE CODE : 
        import java.util.Scanner;
        class GFG {
            public static void main(String[] args) {
                Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
                int n = sc.nextInt();
                int m = sc.nextInt();
                // code here
                for(int i=1;i<=n;i++){
                    for(int j=1;j<=m;j++){
                        if(i==1 || i==n || j==1 || j==m){
                            System.out.print("*");
                        }
                        else{
                            System.out.print(" ");
                        }
                    }
                    System.out.println();
                }
            }
        }
